{"level":"info","message":"saved status: OK, value: {\"id\":\"2661e9fe-2b6a-4f90-9345-914c495a60fb\",\"status\":2,\"type\":0,\"prompt\":{\"req\":[\"How should I go about starting a business?\",\"How should I go about starting a business?\",\"How should I go about starting a business?\",\"How should I go about starting a business?\",\"How should I go about starting a business?\",\"How should I go about starting a business?\",\"How should I go about starting a business?\"],\"res\":[\"{\\n\\\"steps\\\": [\\n    \\\"Define the business idea, including mission statement, target market, and unique value proposition.\\\",\\n    \\\"Conduct market research to understand competition, industry trends, and potential customers.\\\",\\n    \\\"Create a business plan outlining goals, strategies, financial projections, and operational structure.\\\",\\n    \\\"Develop a minimum viable product (MVP) or prototype to test with early customers.\\\",\\n    \\\"Establish an online presence through a website and social media channels.\\\"\\n]\\n}\",\"\\n\\nThe previous plan did not accomplish the following: \\\"[{\\\\\\\"feedback_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"missing\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"step_index\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\"feedback_text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The plan is missing a clear description of the business's legal structure and ownership.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"feedback_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"weak\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"step_index\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"feedback_text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The financial projections should be more detailed, including projected income statements, balance sheets, and cash flow statements.\\\\\\\"}]\\\"\\n\\n\",\"\\n\\nThe previous plan did not accomplish the following: \\\"[{\\\\\\\"feedback_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"missing\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"step_index\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\"feedback_text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The plan is missing a clear description of the business's legal structure and ownership.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"feedback_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"weak\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"step_index\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"feedback_text\\\\\\\":\\\